<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise to pick telecoms ally by summer.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise to pick telecoms ally by summer.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lyonnaise des Eaux said on Friday it would choose an ally in the telecommunications sector before the summer but, neither Lyonnaise nor Bouygues confirmed a report that the two were planning to team up in the sector.</p>
<p>A Lyonnaise spokeswoman said she would not confirm the report in Le Monde newspaper. And at Bouygues, a spokesman said there were &quot;no negotiations with Lyonnaise&quot;.</p>
<p>Le Monde newspaper said on Friday that the two firms could strike a telecoms deal in the coming weeks.</p>
</text>
